  "headline": "Tobramycin is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21",
  "headline_cites": ["D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show tobramycin is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 539 eachs of the 300 mg/4 mL presentation with 35 days on hand at 15.4 eachs per day.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 257 eachs of the same presentation with 15.6 days on hand at 16.5 eachs per day.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "For the 300 mg/5 mL presentation, Corvale East has 354 eachs lasting 24.5 days and Corvale General has 293 eachs lasting 18.3 days.",
      "cites": ["D3", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list notes Hospira, Inc., a Pfizer Company, to be discontinued as of 2026-07-17 for tobramycin sulfate injection.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Advanced Rx Pharmacy of Tennessee, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    }
  ]
}
